# Day-to-day: incident response runbook: detect, triage severity, mitigate, communicate, post-mortem.
title "Incident runbook"
dir DOWN
alert(Alert fires) :red
ack[Acknowledge page]
sev{Severity?} :yellow
sev1[Declare SEV1; open bridge] :red
sev2[Investigate in-channel] :orange
mitigate[Mitigate: rollback or failover]
verify{Recovered?} :yellow
comms[Status page update]
pm[Post-mortem] :green
alert -> ack -> sev
sev -> sev1 : SEV1
sev -> sev2 : SEV2+
sev1 -> mitigate
sev2 -> mitigate
mitigate -> verify
verify -> mitigate : no
verify -> comms : yes
comms -> pm
sev1 -> comms : every 30 min
